"Can you service Mitsubishi CVT gearboxes in Dubai?","Yes &mdash; we carry out the correct CVT drain and refill procedure for INVECS-III and CVT-8 gearboxes with Mitsubishi-specified fluid. A proper CVT service every 40,000&ndash;60,000 km significantly extends gearbox life.",
"Do you work on the Mitsubishi L200 in Dubai?","Yes &mdash; the L200 Triton is a regular in our workshop. We service the 2.4L MIVEC petrol engine, automatic gearbox and the Easy Select 4WD system.",
"Can you fix Mitsubishi 4WD problems?","Yes &mdash; Pajero Super Select II, L200 Easy Select and Outlander 4WD systems are all within our capability, including transfer case rebuilds and 4WD control module diagnostics.",
"How often should I service my Mitsubishi in Dubai?","We recommend 8,000&ndash;10,000 km service intervals. The Outlander CVT fluid should be replaced every 40,000&ndash;60,000 km &mdash; the single most important preventive service for these vehicles.",
